        <body>
            <div xml:id="d597-a1">

                <pb facs="2274" n="2169" sameAs="frus:frus1958-60v03mSupp/pg2169"/>


                <head>Letter From Gray to Herter</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1960-09-13">September 13,
                        1960</date></dateline>
                    <salute>Dear Chris:</salute>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d597-2" n="2" type="facsimile" xml:id="d597-2"/>
                <p>I inclose a rather hastily prepared set of comments with respect to the suggested
                    letter from the President and the statement of functions of the new U.S.
                    Disarmament Administration which you sent to me with your letter of September 9.
                    I submit these for whatever they may be worth to you.</p>
                <p>With warm regards, I am,</p>
                <p>Sincerely,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Gordon Gray</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Special Assistant to the President</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
